+ row  `private def typeKindToFrame(kind: jlc.TypeKind): Frame = kind match …`  S4 S7 S9  4  privato, una chiamata  7
+ row  `def toJulianDay(date: Date): Int = … arithmetic …`  S4 S9 X2  −1  tre chiamate  −1
